<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="OBA" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Abdiyu Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Abdiyu Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Abdi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abdiyu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abdiyu Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha Abdiyu maxaafay, hayqo abbaafe dugeha baggan de7iya Edoome bolla gakana pirda odees. Edoome asay, Yisaaqa nayta, Eesawu sheeshata. Entika Yayqooba isha Eesawu banta mayzan ceeqitiya gisho Isra7eele dabbota. Ha qantha maxaafay Yerusalaamey K.Y.S. 586 laythan laaletidaape guye de7iya woden xaafetis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Abdiyu maxaafay nam7u kifiletan shaaketees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Paydo 1-14 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Edoome asay banta otoro nagara gishonne Yihuda kundethaninne Yerusalaame laaletethan ufaytida gisho pirdetanaw de7eysa entaw odees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Paydo 15-21 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Edoomey Isra7eele morketara issife xoonetanaysanne iita pirda ekanaw de7eysa odees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Edoome otoruwanne pirdetetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="OBA 1:1-9">1-9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Edoome wozana minotethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="OBA 1:10-14">10-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eeley xoonana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="OBA 1:15-21">15-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="OBA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Edoome Otoruwanne Pirdetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="OBA 1:1" />Abdiyuy be7ida qoncethaa. Godaa Xoossay Edoomeba haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="OBA 1:1">Edoomeba Goday, ba kiittiya addiya bolla kawotethatas kiittidaysa nuuni si7ida; “Dendite! Edoome olanaw boos” yaagis. <verse eid="OBA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="OBA 1:2" />“Heko, ta nena kawotethata giddon laafa kessana; neeni daro kadhetidaysa gidana. <verse eid="OBA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="OBA 1:3" />Neno, zaalla qopho giddon de7eyso, ne keethaa dhoqa dereta bolla keexidayso, ne wozanan, ‘Tana haysafe sa7an wodhisanay oonee?’ yaageyso, nena ne wozanaa otoroy cimmis. <verse eid="OBA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="OBA 1:4" />Ne arganthada pude haakada piradhikoka, ne keethaa xoolintota giddon keexikoka, ta nena yaape duge wodhisana” yaagees Xoossay.<verse eid="OBA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="OBA 1:5" />“Kaysoy woyko banqiya asi qamma yiiko, bantaw gideysa mela xalaala kaysotokonayee? Woyne maxeysati maxishe, poshile ashshokonaayee? Shin ne morketi nena polo dhaysana. <verse eid="OBA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="OBA 1:6" />Abeeti Eesawey waanidi bonqetandee? Qosan de7iya iya shaloy waanidi eketandee? <verse eid="OBA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="OBA 1:7" />Neera caaqidaysati ubbay nena ne biittafe gooddana; qassi ne ammanetida laggeti cimmidi nena xoonana. Ne kathaa midaysati ne ogen gite yeggana, shin neeni hessa akeekaka” yaagees.<verse eid="OBA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="OBA 1:8" />“He gallas taani Edoomepe cincatanne Eesawe zumaape akeeka dhaysana. <verse eid="OBA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="OBA 1:9" />Hinteno, Temaana asato, hinte olanchoti dagammana; Eesawe zuma bolla de7iya asa ubbay goyretana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="OBA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoome Wozana Minotethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="OBA 1:10" />Ne ishaa Yayqooba bolla ne oothida iitabaa gisho, ne yeella ma77ana; ne merinaw dhayana. <verse eid="OBA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="OBA 1:11" />Imathatinne allagati iya shaluwa bonqiya gallas neeni gaxa keyada eqa xeelladasa. Qassi iya pengera gelidi, Yerusalaame katamaa bolla saama yeggiya wode neeni entafe issuwa mela gidadasa. <verse eid="OBA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="OBA 1:12" />Neeni ne ishay metootiya gallas iya metuwan ufaytanaw bessennashin; Yihuda asaa bolla waayey gakiya gallas hashshu gaanaw bessennashin. Enta un7a gallasan otoron odetanaw bessennashin! <verse eid="OBA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="OBA 1:13" />Neeni enta metuwa gallas ta asay de7iya katamaa gelanaw, enta waayan neeni ufaytanawunne enta metuwa gallas enta shaluwa bonqanaw bessennashin! <verse eid="OBA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="OBA 1:14" />Baqateyisata wodhanaw neeni daggala ogen naaganawunne attidaysata enta un7aa gallas morketas aathada immanaw bessennashin!<verse eid="OBA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeley Xoonana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="OBA 1:15" />Godaa pirda gallasay kawotethata ubbaa bolla matis. Neno Edoome, neeni harata bolla oothidabay ne bolla oosetana; ne oosoy ne bolla simmana. <verse eid="OBA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="OBA 1:16" />Ta geeshsha zumaa bolla ne uyidaysa mela kawotetha ubbay qanxonna uyana; gujidika uyana; enti kase hani eronnabaa hanana.<verse eid="OBA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="OBA 1:17" />“Shin Xiyoone zuman kessi ekidaysati daana; Xiyooney geeshshi gidana; Yayqooba kochay banta biitta zaari laattana. <verse eid="OBA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="OBA 1:18" />Yayqooba kochay tama gidana; Yoosefa kochay laco gidana; Eesawe kochay buure gidana. Tami buure meysada, Yayqooba zerethaynne Yoosefa kochay Eesawe kochaa midi polo dhaysana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="OBA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="OBA 1:19" />Negebe mela biittan de7iya asay Eesawe zuma laattana; gadha biittan de7iya asay Filisxeeme biitta, Efreema biittanne Samaare biitta laattana. Qassi Biniyaame kochay Galada biitta laattana. <verse eid="OBA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="OBA 1:20" />Di7etethafe simmida Isra7eele asay, Kanaanepe bidi Sirafta gakanaw de7iya biitta laattana. Yerusalaamepe de7etidi, Safarada geetetiya bessan de7iya asati Negebe katamata laattana. <verse eid="OBA 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="OBA 1:21" />Ashsheysati Eesawe asaa haaranaw Xiyoone zuma bolla keyana; kawotethay Godaaba gidana.<verse eid="OBA 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="OBA 1" />
</usx>